_loc":"Narasingam near Mattuthavani, Madurai","p3_status":"Available","p3_desc":"Luxury residential enclave situated close to Mattuthavani Omni Bus Stand and IT Park corridor.","test_subtitle":"Client Trust","test_title":"What Our Happy Customers Say","test_desc":"Read genuine feedback from families who purchased their dream plots through Kopuram Promoter & Builders.","cta_title":"Ready to Own Your Dream Plot in Madurai?","cta_desc":"Schedule a free site visit with our experienced team today. Free cab facility available for family visits!","cta_btn":"Book Free Site Visit Now","about_story_title":"Our 20+ Year Journey of Excellence","about_story_desc":"Founded with a clear vision to make land buying transparent and accessible, Kopuram Promoter & Builders LLP has grown into one of Madurai's most respected names in plot promotion and land development.","mission_title":"Our Mission","mission_desc":"To make home ownership a joyful, secure, and stress-free experience by delivering 100% DTCP & RERA approved plots with absolute legal integrity.","vision_title":"Our Vision","vision_desc":"To remain Madurai's benchmark for excellence, sustainability, and trust in real estate land development for generations to come.","contact_title":"Get in Touch With Us","contact_subtitle":"Visit our office in Anna Nagar, Madurai, or send us a direct inquiry.","form_name":"Full Name","form_phone":"Phone Number","form_email":"Email Address","form_project":"Select Preferred Layout","form_date":"Preferred Date","form_time":"Preferred Time","form_message":"Your Message / Query","form_submit":"Submit Inquiry","form_book_submit":"Confirm Site Visit Booking","footer_tagline":"Kopuram Promoter and Builders LLP - 20+ Years of Excellence in Land Development in Madurai.","footer_quick_links":"Quick Links","footer_contact_info":"Office Contact","footer_legal_notice":"All layout developments are government DTCP and RERA approved. Complete legal documentation guaranteed.","footer_rights":"© 2026 Kopuram P